    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Homelander\u2019s Valor</strong> is a roguelite Tower Defense strategy game with tactical control over your hero and units. Build defenses, lead your troops, and survive the day-night cycle in a world shaped by the legends of the Silk Road\u2014where every choice can turn the tide of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809580/extras/e0f8af099717fcaa813171234c38f9bb.avif?t=1753011341\" width=616 height=85 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you explore, gather resources, recruit warriors, and create your own bastion.\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, you fend off enemy waves from two flanks while controlling your hero in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The loop is simple: prepare by day \u2014 survive by night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809580/extras/84fd890f9438ee2e6d18edcd4cb89a15.avif?t=1753011341\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tower evolves along a tech tree: first, choose its attack type \u2014 catapult, ballista, archer, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, enhance it with a unique effect like fire, poison, fear, or stun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This system isn\u2019t just about raw power \u2014 it\u2019s about giving each tower a distinct tactical role in your defense.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809580/extras/c92a59b665ed706859e446109162b93d.avif?t=1753011341\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You choose where to build \u2014 and take full responsibility for the outcome.\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fixed build points: place towers, barricades, and workshops anywhere on the level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your defense takes shape based on enemy direction and your chosen tactics. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run becomes a custom strategic build with total control in your hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809580/extras/7d9a3f76a73c71b865516948425f2a39.avif?t=1753011341\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time control \u2014 without the chaos</strong>. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The minimap is an active tool that shows wave directions, unit positions, and flank status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to respond quickly: reposition your hero, reassign troops, and make split-second decisions that shape the outcome of each battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809580/extras/ddeaef0f17d4d3d90e964e5966206613.avif?t=1753011341\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world inspired by Eastern myths \u2014 no magic, only relics, symbols of power, and enemies driven by darkness.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, the hero isn\u2019t the chosen one \u2014 he\u2019s the last one left standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not defending a base. You\u2019re protecting a banner, your honor, and those who still stand behind you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Homelander\u2019s Valor</strong> is a roguelite Tower Defense strategy game with tactical control over your hero and units. Build defenses, lead your troops, and survive the day-night cycle in a world shaped by the legends of the Silk Road\u2014where every choice can turn the tide of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809580/extras/e0f8af099717fcaa813171234c38f9bb.avif?t=1753011341\" width=616 height=85 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you explore, gather resources, recruit warriors, and create your own bastion.\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, you fend off enemy waves from two flanks while controlling your hero in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The loop is simple: prepare by day \u2014 survive by night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809580/extras/84fd890f9438ee2e6d18edcd4cb89a15.avif?t=1753011341\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tower evolves along a tech tree: first, choose its attack type \u2014 catapult, ballista, archer, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, enhance it with a unique effect like fire, poison, fear, or stun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This system isn\u2019t just about raw power \u2014 it\u2019s about giving each tower a distinct tactical role in your defense.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809580/extras/c92a59b665ed706859e446109162b93d.avif?t=1753011341\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You choose where to build \u2014 and take full responsibility for the outcome.\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fixed build points: place towers, barricades, and workshops anywhere on the level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your defense takes shape based on enemy direction and your chosen tactics. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run becomes a custom strategic build with total control in your hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809580/extras/7d9a3f76a73c71b865516948425f2a39.avif?t=1753011341\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time control \u2014 without the chaos</strong>. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The minimap is an active tool that shows wave directions, unit positions, and flank status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to respond quickly: reposition your hero, reassign troops, and make split-second decisions that shape the outcome of each battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809580/extras/ddeaef0f17d4d3d90e964e5966206613.avif?t=1753011341\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world inspired by Eastern myths \u2014 no magic, only relics, symbols of power, and enemies driven by darkness.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, the hero isn\u2019t the chosen one \u2014 he\u2019s the last one left standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not defending a base. You\u2019re protecting a banner, your honor, and those who still stand behind you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
